Dear {!Case.Account}
{!Case.PMC_SS_Location__c} has reported a low stock or no stock of {!Case.Product} . To prevent immediate inconvenience to your shipping plans we wish to advise the following orders identified.
Customer PO number Mosaic order number
We apologize for the impact to your business. As we work on replenishment, we will update you with product ETA immediately so you can resume pick- up. Please reach out to your Customer Service Representative for further questions.
{!Case.OwnerFullName}
